{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/17344","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:21.285887+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"NONE","body":"To add - at the moment I'm getting around this by using lax.gather directly (hopefully correctly), which seems to work fine on both CPU and Metal.\r\n\r\n```\r\nfrom jax import lax\r\n\r\nlax.gather(array, \r\n           jnp.concatenate((jnp.arange(len(idx)).reshape(-1, 1), idx), axis=1),\r\n           lax.GatherDimensionNumbers(\r\n                 offset_dims=tuple([]),\r\n                 collapsed_slice_dims=tuple([0, 1]),\r\n                 start_index_map=tuple([0, 1])), \r\n           tuple([1, 1]))\r\n```","created_at":"2023-08-30T11:18:01Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/17344#issuecomment-1698967275","id":1698967275,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/17344","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc5lRC7r","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1698967275/reactions"},"updated_at":"2023-08-30T11:18:01Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1698967275","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/100413067?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdgfrost/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdgfrost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdgfrost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdgfrost/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tdgfrost","id":100413067,"login":"tdgfrost","node_id":"U_kgDOBfwuiw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdgfrost/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdgfrost/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdgfrost/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https:/